  "acceptance": [
    "Separate worker root/config/DB lifecycle uses the existing durable outbox/account-lock seam and current transactional eligibility, never API/session/focus/room bootstrap. Static negative boundary cases and actual worker operation beside and after API owner confirm scope.",
    "API keeps all room-bound maintenance. Default role and legacy retry SQL remain compatible; explicit worker role skips periodic API dispatch and requires matching immutable policy during cutover.",
    "Existing durable effect/account/source/consumer uniqueness handles concurrent workers and actual kill-at-COMMIT with uncertain acknowledgement; restart does not duplicate2 rewards/1 receipt.",
    "Explicit worker retry limit quarantines poison work, bounded metadata inspection and optimistic count/due-time retry reject stale cycles/foreign consumers/concurrent repeats/completed receipts. Legacy default retry regression preserved.",
    "Worker validates image-bound schema read-only before jobs, refuses unknown history without migrating and applies current DB safety restrictions. Implemented worker:check and normal compiled API prerequisite before actual checks."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Local source/compiled Node and disposable PostgreSQL, not a published API image/registry/hosted/cluster/staging/production qualification. Compiled graph hash is scoped, not a complete image/SBOM.",
    "Explicit policy/role cutover is deployment-owned; no global DB policy-hash registry. Do not mix policies/legacy consumers; rollback can resume quarantined rows and needs inspection.",
    "CLI assumes trusted OS/DB access; no remote MFA/admin audit or permanent operator-command idempotency ledger. N07/N08 own controls/alerts/freshness; batch exit0 is not whole-queue health or capacity.",
    "Real SIGKILL at deferred COMMIT observed committed effects+receipt; atomic rollback alternative is allowed and resolves through durable retry. Whole PG/network outages, SIGINT and more crash boundaries not separately qualified worker cases.",
    "Earlier WIP gates precede final retry timestamp/default compatibility refinements; final worker-qualified and full checks apply to frozen source. All failed attempts retained.",
    "No fresh full browser/mobile/store/hosted/public/operator/adult/media release approval. Known hosted cadence/enforcement unresolved, N13/N14 inactive, raw artifacts private local not off-host archived."
  ],
